<title>HUNGARY: Hungary two yr govt bond yield falls to 23.49 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary two yr govt bond yield falls to 23.49 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of Hungary's 1998/J government bond was set by auction at 23.49 percent, down from 25.49 percent at auction four weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Thursday  HTBK.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     44,025.84 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    6,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 6,300 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    23.49 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		    101.73 pct</p>
</text>
